name clrdblpg
category Package
revision 47511
shortdesc Control pagestyle of pages left blank by \cleardoublepage
relocated 1
longdesc This tiny package allows easy manipulation of the headers and
longdesc footers on pages left blank by \cleardoublepage. By default,
longdesc LaTeX has no easy facilities for this. This package uses more
longdesc or less the algorithm listed in the fancyhdr package
longdesc documentation, with some better indentation and added
longdesc flexibility.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/clrdblpg/clrdblpg.sty
catalogue-also fancyhdr
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/clrdblpg
